
~ title

Shop

=>


~ start

What would you like to do?

- Buy
	=> buy
- Sell
	=> sell
- Leave
	=> END

=> END


~ buy

What would you like to buy?

- Ration (1x for 1 gold)
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.GOLD, 1)
		do inventory.add( Items.FOOD, 1 )
		do inventory.remove( Items.GOLD, 1 )
		1x Food purchased for 1 gold.
	else
		You do not have enough gold! You need {{Game.inventory.difference(Items.GOLD, 1)}} more gold.
	=> buy

- Bandage (2 gold) 
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.GOLD, 2)
		do inventory.add( Items.MEDICINE, 1 )
		do inventory.remove( Items.GOLD, 2 )
		1x Bandage purchased for 2 gold.
	else
		You do not have enough gold! You need {{Game.inventory.difference(Items.GOLD, 2)}} more gold.
	=> buy

- Healing Salve (3 gold) 
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.GOLD, 3)
		do inventory.add( Items.MEDICINE, 1 )
		do inventory.remove( Items.GOLD, 3 )
		1x Healing Salve purchased for 3 gold.
	else
		You do not have enough gold! You need {{Game.inventory.difference(Items.GOLD, 3)}} more gold.
	=> buy

- Return
	=> start

=> END


~ sell

What would you like to sell?

- Ration (1x for 1 gold) 
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.FOOD, 1)
		do inventory.remove( Items.FOOD, 1 )
		do inventory.add( Items.GOLD, 1 )
		1x Food sold for 1 gold.
	else
		You do not have enough food! You need {{Game.inventory.difference(Items.FOOD, 1)}} more food.
	=> sell

- Bandage (1x for 1 gold) 
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.MEDICINE, 1)
		do inventory.remove( Items.MEDICINE, 1 )
		do inventory.add( Items.GOLD, 1 )
		1x Bandage sold for 1 gold.
	else
		You do not have enough Bandages! You need {{Game.inventory.difference(Items.MEDICINE, 1)}} more bandages.
	=> sell

- Return
	=> start

=> END